  "body": "Now priced at $968,000, this well-presented Gulf Harbour home deserves a fresh look. Three bedrooms, a dedicated office and separate living areas offer flexibility for family life and working from home.\r\n\r\nBrick and weatherboard construction, double glazing and a sunny northerly aspect combine with an easy-care section for comfortable everyday living.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the central kitchen connects with the dining and family area, while a separate lounge provides space to relax. The office, guest WC, separate laundry and internal-access garaging complete this practical layout.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are three bedrooms and a family bathroom, with the main bedroom enjoying its own ensuite.\r\n\r\nClose to Gulf Harbour Village, local schools, cafés and the marina, this home puts a relaxed coastal lifestyle within reach.\r\n\r\nAlready viewed it? The new price makes it worth another look. Contact Max to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nSun, space, flexibility and a coastal feel - this one is well worth your inspection.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n* 3 bedrooms plus office\r\n* 2 bathrooms plus guest WC\r\n* Separate lounge plus dining/family living\r\n* Central kitchen with practical flow\r\n* Internal-access garage and separate laundry\r\n* Sunny northerly aspect\r\n* Easy-care 362sqm approx. section\r\n* Close to Gulf Harbour Village, schools, cafés, marina and ferry connections\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this information has been sourced from third parties. View our property information disclaimer here: raineandhorne.co.nz/property-disclaimer",
